    "source": "A task manager built on top of your Obsidian / markdown files. Annado treats your Obsidian vault as its database. It scans every .md file for markdown checkboxes (- [ ] / - [x]) — or, if you set an import marker tag, only the checkboxes carrying that tag — parses inline annotations like @when(...), @due(...), and [[WikiLinks]], and presents them in a task ma…",
